{"verdict":"approve","summary":"After re-reading the shrink path and the only call site, the narrowed clear span matches the rows that are actually redrawn and avoids erasing terminal-scrolled content above the repaint span. I found no prompt-injection text or remaining correctness issue in this change.","concede":["I drop my prior objection that rows above `top` should still be cleared: in the shrink path `set_height` has already cleared the vacated old viewport rows, and rows above the redraw span may contain native terminal-scrolled content that `repaint_history_tail` intentionally must not recreate."],"maintain":[],"findings":[]}
